<Sync time="74.189"/>
ke:mah achichi sah pero a:mo te:kehtsomah no:, ti:ltikeh a:mo te:kehtsomah iw..., no: iwki tein nextikeh a:mo te:kehtsomah, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="81.094" endTime="91.313">
